{
  "slug": "agent4s",
  "name": "Agent4s",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scala code intelligence for AI coding agents. 35 commands — search,\njump-to-definition, find references, call-graph, dead code detection, semantic\nrename, bug-hunt with taint analysis, scaffolding — all without a build\nserver or compilation. Cold index 2.7s, warm 349ms on 18k files. Bug-hunt\nscans 45 vulnerability patterns (SQL injection, XSS, SSRF, hardcoded secrets, weak crypto, concurrency bugs) with cross-file taint analysis. SemanticDB integration for type-aware mode when compiled artifacts are available. Native binaries for macOS, Linux, and Windows. Works as a Claude Code plugin, MCP server (Cursor, Windsurf, Cline), or standalone CLI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `agent4s` (Scala superpowers for AI agents), `audit` (Comprehensive Scala codebase audit — code smells, dead code, complexity hotspots, test coverage gaps, security issues), `bug-hunt` (Scan Scala codebase for 45 AST-based bug patterns with taint analysis), `critique` (Evaluate Scala architecture and design quality), `doctor` (Diagnostic check for agent4s), `extract` (Extract reusable components from Scala code — traits, type classes, shared modules, common patterns), `harden` (Strengthen Scala code against edge cases, errors, and production failures), `normalize` (Align Scala code to project conventions and patterns), and 6 more\n- **Agents** (1): `scala-expert` (Use this agent for complex Scala tasks that require chaining 3+ scalex commands together)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent4s@claude-community` from `scala-digest/agent4s` (`plugins/agent4s`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
